<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:20.125" end="00:00:22.000" style="s2">When making AI videos,</p>
<p begin="00:00:22.000" end="00:00:23.750" style="s2">we often change the prompt</p>
<p begin="00:00:23.750" end="00:00:25.375" style="s2">and generate again.</p>
<p begin="00:00:25.375" end="00:00:26.416" style="s2">We keep trying,</p>
<p begin="00:00:26.416" end="00:00:28.916" style="s2">but the workflow keeps breaking.</p>
<p begin="00:00:28.916" end="00:00:31.875" style="s2">It’s time to bring that workflow together.</p>
<p begin="00:00:32.083" end="00:00:35.166" style="s2">Bring your references and generated scenes together</p>
<p begin="00:00:35.166" end="00:00:38.041" style="s2">in Dreamina AI Canvas today.</p>
<p begin="00:00:38.041" end="00:00:39.500" style="s2">Compare results,</p>
<p begin="00:00:39.500" end="00:00:42.083" style="s2">revisit earlier steps to refine your work,</p>
<p begin="00:00:42.083" end="00:00:44.291" style="s2">and keep your story moving.</p>
<p begin="00:00:44.291" end="00:00:45.750" style="s2">From the Prompt Era</p>
<p begin="00:00:45.750" end="00:00:47.875" style="s2">to the Canvas-first Era.</p>
<p begin="00:00:47.875" end="00:00:51.208" style="s2">This is Dreamina AI Canvas.</p>
<p begin="00:00:51.208" end="00:00:54.916" style="s2">Let’s explore the process of creating a story together.</p>
<p begin="00:00:54.916" end="00:00:57.166" style="s2">First, bring your prepared story,</p>
<p begin="00:00:57.166" end="00:00:59.041" style="s2">character sheets, and background references</p>
<p begin="00:00:59.041" end="00:01:01.250" style="s2">into one workspace.</p>
<p begin="00:01:01.250" end="00:01:03.041" style="s2">Connect your prepared character sheets</p>
<p begin="00:01:03.041" end="00:01:04.125" style="s2">and background references</p>
<p begin="00:01:04.125" end="00:01:06.250" style="s2">to a video generation node,</p>
<p begin="00:01:06.250" end="00:01:07.916" style="s2">bringing the characters and spaces</p>
<p begin="00:01:07.916" end="00:01:10.333" style="s2">of your story together.</p>
<p begin="00:01:10.333" end="00:01:12.041" style="s2">Once your references are connected,</p>
<p begin="00:01:12.041" end="00:01:14.750" style="s2">describe the action and camera movement.</p>
<p begin="00:01:14.750" end="00:01:16.041" style="s2">Then bring your scene to life</p>
<p begin="00:01:16.041" end="00:01:18.500" style="s2">with Seedance 2.5,</p>
<p begin="00:01:18.500" end="00:01:20.583" style="s2">guided by those references.</p>
<p begin="00:01:20.583" end="00:01:23.333" style="s2">Plan your composition in Director Console.</p>
<p begin="00:01:25.375" end="00:01:27.750" style="s2">With Cinema Kit, set the color palette,</p>
<p begin="00:01:27.750" end="00:01:30.625" style="s2">visual style, and motion presets.</p>
<p begin="00:01:30.625" end="00:01:31.833" style="s2">Whenever you need help,</p>
<p begin="00:01:31.833" end="00:01:35.125" style="s2">discuss your next step with the AI Agent.</p>
<p begin="00:01:35.125" end="00:01:37.041" style="s2">Build your story in parts,</p>
<p begin="00:01:37.041" end="00:01:39.458" style="s2">creating each scene in sequence.</p>
<p begin="00:01:39.458" end="00:01:43.083" style="s2">Refine a node and compare versions before continuing.</p>
<p begin="00:01:43.083" end="00:01:45.416" style="s2">Build a rough cut on the canvas timeline and</p>
<p begin="00:01:45.416" end="00:01:47.666" style="s2">find your story’s rhythm.</p>
<p begin="00:01:47.666" end="00:01:48.833" style="s2">For finer editing,</p>
<p begin="00:01:48.833" end="00:01:50.833" style="s2">export your project and original assets</p>
<p begin="00:01:50.833" end="00:01:52.833" style="s2">to professional editing software</p>
<p begin="00:01:52.833" end="00:01:55.333" style="s2">with the editing structure intact.</p>
<p begin="00:01:55.333" end="00:01:56.750" style="s2">All of this is possible</p>
<p begin="00:01:56.750" end="00:01:58.666" style="s2">in Dreamina Canvas.</p>
<p begin="00:01:58.666" end="00:02:00.375" style="s2">Dreamina 2.0 —</p>
<p begin="00:02:00.375" end="00:02:02.791" style="s2">The New Creative Standard.</p>
<p begin="00:02:02.791" end="00:02:03.958" style="s2">Canvas-first —</p>
<p begin="00:02:03.958" end="00:02:06.666" style="s2">the new way AI video is made.</p>
<p begin="00:02:06.666" end="00:02:07.708" style="s2">Follow Dreamina </p>
<p begin="00:02:07.708" end="00:02:12.958" style="s2">and click the link in the description to try it for yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:02:35.833" end="00:02:40.625" style="s2">When Jaei came back after three years, she felt like a stranger.</p>
<p begin="00:02:40.833" end="00:02:44.458" style="s2">Just like nine years ago, in that alley where she saved me,</p>
<p begin="00:02:44.458" end="00:02:46.708" style="s2">when we first met...</p>
<p begin="00:02:47.583" end="00:02:49.666" style="s2">Hiding her feelings,</p>
<p begin="00:02:49.666" end="00:02:52.833" style="s2">behind a wall she’d built to keep everyone out,</p>
<p begin="00:02:54.458" end="00:02:59.000" style="s2">just like she was back then...</p>
<p begin="00:03:03.458" end="00:03:06.125" style="s2">In words I couldn’t understand,</p>
<p begin="00:03:06.125" end="00:03:08.291" style="s2">Jaei, who had never told me before,</p>
<p begin="00:03:08.291" end="00:03:11.125" style="s2">began telling me her own story.</p>
<p begin="00:03:11.125" end="00:03:14.500" style="s2">Stories hard to believe, even as I heard them...</p>
<p begin="00:03:16.958" end="00:03:19.583" style="s2">The whole time she spoke,</p>
<p begin="00:03:19.583" end="00:03:21.958" style="s2">I tried to keep it off my face.</p>
<p begin="00:03:21.958" end="00:03:24.791" style="s2">So she wouldn&#39;t notice...</p>
<p begin="00:03:26.791" end="00:03:29.208" style="s2">I was afraid that if she saw how shocked I was,</p>
<p begin="00:03:29.208" end="00:03:30.458" style="s2">she&#39;d shut herself away</p>
<p begin="00:03:30.458" end="00:03:34.916" style="s2">behind that wall again.</p>
<p begin="00:03:38.291" end="00:03:42.083" style="s2">But Jaei never once looked me in the eye,</p>
<p begin="00:03:43.958" end="00:03:47.708" style="s2">and she poured out her story without giving me a chance to speak.</p>
<p begin="00:03:57.833" end="00:04:00.958" style="s2">And so her story came to an end,</p>
<p begin="00:04:00.958" end="00:04:04.458" style="s2">and Jaei paused for a moment, as though she was wavering.</p>
<p begin="00:04:05.833" end="00:04:09.875" style="s2">Was she waiting for my answer...?</p>
<p begin="00:04:09.875" end="00:04:14.958" style="s2">But in the end, I couldn&#39;t say a single word to her...</p>
<p begin="00:04:15.500" end="00:04:18.541" style="s2">There was so much I&#39;d wanted to ask when I saw her.</p>
<p begin="00:04:18.541" end="00:04:22.750" style="s2">How had she been? Hadn&#39;t she missed me?</p>
<p begin="00:04:22.750" end="00:04:25.500" style="s2">Why did I do that...?</p>
<p begin="00:04:25.500" end="00:04:29.500" style="s2">She’d always pretended to be strong, to be fine.</p>
<p begin="00:04:29.500" end="00:04:32.541" style="s2">I knew how she must have felt, telling me all this.</p>
<p begin="00:04:33.958" end="00:04:37.916" style="s2">I wanted to tell her I understood, to ask her not to go...</p>
<p begin="00:04:39.333" end="00:04:41.333" style="s2">Well...</p>
<p begin="00:04:41.333" end="00:04:42.958" style="s2">take care.</p>
<p begin="00:04:55.458" end="00:04:59.666" style="s2">And while I was searching for the words, I lost her.</p>
<p begin="00:04:59.666" end="00:05:02.250" style="s2">And so Jaei, back after three years,</p>
<p begin="00:05:02.250" end="00:05:07.083" style="s2">left without once being able to look me in the eye.</p>
<p begin="00:05:08.458" end="00:05:13.833" style="s2">This time, it really was our final goodbye.</p>
<p begin="00:05:15.833" end="00:05:19.666" style="s2">In the end, I was the one who hadn&#39;t given her a chance...</p>
<p begin="00:05:19.666" end="00:05:23.208" style="s2">My promise to be her family and friend for life...</p>
<p begin="00:05:25.458" end="00:05:30.208" style="s2">was never kept...</p>
<p begin="00:05:33.083" end="00:05:37.708" style="s2">FISSURE</p>
<p begin="00:05:57.750" end="00:06:00.000" style="s2">Hey, you. J&#39;s little lackey!</p>
<p begin="00:06:22.291" end="00:06:24.833" style="s2">Hey, you look ready to bite someone&#39;s head off.</p>
<p begin="00:06:24.833" end="00:06:27.666" style="s2">Can&#39;t you look a little sweeter?</p>
<p begin="00:06:32.291" end="00:06:34.708" style="s2">Who the hell are you?</p>
<p begin="00:06:34.708" end="00:06:36.958" style="s2">What are you doing here?</p>
<p begin="00:06:36.958" end="00:06:38.791" style="s2">My sister isn&#39;t here right now.</p>
<p begin="00:06:39.875" end="00:06:41.083" style="s2">I know.</p>
<p begin="00:06:42.000" end="00:06:44.458" style="s2">But what&#39;s got our little girl so upset?</p>
<p begin="00:06:51.958" end="00:06:55.000" style="s2">Who the hell do you think you are,</p>
<p begin="00:06:55.000" end="00:06:57.708" style="s2">messing with me like this?</p>
<p begin="00:06:57.708" end="00:06:59.916" style="s2">Do you want to die?!</p>
<p begin="00:07:01.083" end="00:07:03.958" style="s2">What, are you going to make a scene here?</p>
<p begin="00:07:16.375" end="00:07:17.958" style="s2">Oh, baby.</p>
<p begin="00:07:19.458" end="00:07:21.875" style="s2">You&#39;re scared that sister you can&#39;t live without</p>
<p begin="00:07:23.500" end="00:07:25.875" style="s2">is going to leave you, aren&#39;t you?</p>
<p begin="00:07:27.208" end="00:07:29.458" style="s2">I might be able to help with that.</p>
<p begin="00:07:32.208" end="00:07:33.708" style="s2">What do you want from me?</p>
<p begin="00:07:35.333" end="00:07:37.708" style="s2">Oh, now you&#39;re interested?</p>
<p begin="00:07:37.708" end="00:07:40.708" style="s2">Well, if you help me out just a little...</p>
<p begin="00:07:40.958" end="00:07:42.875" style="s2">Those people you&#39;ve seen around J.</p>
<p begin="00:07:43.750" end="00:07:46.166" style="s2">I could get rid of every last one of them.</p>
<p begin="00:07:47.750" end="00:07:50.083" style="s2">Why would you do that?</p>
<p begin="00:07:50.625" end="00:07:52.458" style="s2">...I don&#39;t get it.</p>
<p begin="00:07:53.708" end="00:07:55.833" style="s2">Why go after the people around my sister</p>
<p begin="00:07:55.833" end="00:07:58.375" style="s2">instead of her?</p>
<p begin="00:08:02.166" end="00:08:03.333" style="s2">Oh,</p>
<p begin="00:08:03.333" end="00:08:06.333" style="s2">I&#39;ve got quite a few scores to settle with J.</p>
<p begin="00:08:08.375" end="00:08:10.958" style="s2">But just killing her wouldn&#39;t be much fun.</p>
<p begin="00:08:13.958" end="00:08:16.125" style="s2">I don&#39;t think it would satisfy me, either.</p>
<p begin="00:08:18.583" end="00:08:21.708" style="s2">I&#39;d rather kill the people she cares about</p>
<p begin="00:08:21.708" end="00:08:25.916" style="s2">and watch her suffer for the rest of her life.</p>
<p begin="00:08:27.208" end="00:08:29.125" style="s2">If you cooperate,</p>
<p begin="00:08:29.125" end="00:08:31.708" style="s2">I&#39;ll let J leave Korea with you,</p>
<p begin="00:08:31.708" end="00:08:33.708" style="s2">safe and sound.</p>
<p begin="00:08:34.708" end="00:08:36.958" style="s2">What do you say?</p>
<p begin="00:08:42.125" end="00:08:44.125" style="s2">...And if I don&#39;t help you?</p>
<p begin="00:08:47.208" end="00:08:48.708" style="s2">Then we&#39;ll have to fight</p>
<p begin="00:08:48.708" end="00:08:50.958" style="s2">until one side&#39;s been wiped out.</p>
<p begin="00:08:52.083" end="00:08:56.041" style="s2">I hear you&#39;ve got plenty of reasons to resent J yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:08:56.958" end="00:08:58.875" style="s2">Don&#39;t you feel you&#39;ve been wronged?</p>
<p begin="00:08:59.333" end="00:09:02.416" style="s2">Isn&#39;t it time you were on equal footing with her?</p>
<p begin="00:09:13.208" end="00:09:14.708" style="s2">...What do you need me to do?</p>
<p begin="00:10:10.208" end="00:10:14.333" style="s2">Did you hand over all the information</p>
<p begin="00:10:14.333" end="00:10:15.875" style="s2">to the people Elias sent?</p>
<p begin="00:10:17.083" end="00:10:21.333" style="s2">Yes, sir. Everything, just as you instructed.</p>
<p begin="00:10:23.458" end="00:10:25.250" style="s2">Deputy Director...</p>
<p begin="00:10:25.250" end="00:10:27.583" style="s2">may I ask you something?</p>
<p begin="00:10:28.458" end="00:10:29.583" style="s2">Go ahead.</p>
<p begin="00:10:31.000" end="00:10:33.458" style="s2">If Baekya happens to find out...</p>
<p begin="00:10:33.458" end="00:10:35.291" style="s2">won&#39;t that cause problems?</p>
<p begin="00:10:36.708" end="00:10:38.958" style="s2">What problems?</p>
<p begin="00:10:38.958" end="00:10:42.333" style="s2">It&#39;s about time they replaced some of the old guard.</p>
<p begin="00:10:44.958" end="00:10:46.583" style="s2">That woman...</p>
<p begin="00:10:46.583" end="00:10:48.208" style="s2">that chair was never hers to begin with,</p>
<p begin="00:10:48.208" end="00:10:49.875" style="s2">and she’s been sitting in it far too long.</p>
<p begin="00:10:52.500" end="00:10:55.208" style="s2">Besides, lackeys like that</p>
<p begin="00:10:55.208" end="00:10:56.958" style="s2">need to be replaced every so often</p>
<p begin="00:10:56.958" end="00:10:59.125" style="s2">to keep them from causing trouble.</p>
<p begin="00:11:00.833" end="00:11:01.833" style="s2">Don&#39;t you think?</p>
<p begin="00:11:03.208" end="00:11:04.208" style="s2">Yes, sir...</p>
<p begin="00:11:06.208" end="00:11:08.083" style="s2">And... Deputy Director.</p>
<p begin="00:11:10.708" end="00:11:12.583" style="s2">For God&#39;s sake, why do you keep hesitating?</p>
<p begin="00:11:12.583" end="00:11:13.500" style="s2">Just say it.</p>
<p begin="00:11:16.083" end="00:11:17.708" style="s2">Ms. Seol Hana is a civilian</p>
<p begin="00:11:17.708" end="00:11:20.458" style="s2">with nothing to do with any of this.</p>
<p begin="00:11:20.458" end="00:11:22.458" style="s2">If she gets caught up in it...</p>
<p begin="00:11:25.333" end="00:11:26.083" style="s2">Hey!</p>
<p begin="00:11:26.083" end="00:11:28.583" style="s2">Do I have to worry about every little thing like that right now!?</p>
<p begin="00:11:29.958" end="00:11:31.708" style="s2">Ah... no, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:11:34.250" end="00:11:36.458" style="s2">What, after tailing them for a few years,</p>
<p begin="00:11:36.458" end="00:11:38.458" style="s2">have you grown attached?</p>
<p begin="00:11:38.458" end="00:11:39.666" style="s2">Get your head straight.</p>
<p begin="00:11:41.708" end="00:11:43.125" style="s2">Yes, sir...</p>
<p begin="00:11:43.125" end="00:11:44.541" style="s2">I&#39;m sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:11:45.833" end="00:11:48.708" style="s2">Enough of these pointless worries.</p>
<p begin="00:11:48.708" end="00:11:51.333" style="s2">Once they&#39;re all dealt with,</p>
<p begin="00:11:51.333" end="00:11:53.125" style="s2">just make sure it&#39;s wrapped up without any loose ends.</p>
<p begin="00:11:53.708" end="00:11:56.583" style="s2">Yes, sir. Understood.</p>
<p begin="00:12:20.916" end="00:12:22.541" style="s2">Well, it&#39;s been a long time since I was here.</p>
<p begin="00:12:36.541" end="00:12:38.500" style="s2">Damn it.</p>
<p begin="00:12:38.500" end="00:12:40.208" style="s2">They call me all the way out here</p>
<p begin="00:12:40.208" end="00:12:42.541" style="s2">and can&#39;t even come pick me up?</p>
<p begin="00:12:43.458" end="00:12:46.833" style="s2">That bitch Jian. No manners at all.</p>
<p begin="00:12:46.833" end="00:12:48.708" style="s2">Just wait till I get my hands on her.</p>
<p begin="00:13:28.791" end="00:13:32.000" style="s2">Oh, there&#39;s our gorgeous girl! We meet again!</p>
<p begin="00:13:33.500" end="00:13:35.916" style="s2">Oh...? Yes. Hello.</p>
<p begin="00:13:37.083" end="00:13:38.166" style="s2">Off to work?</p>
<p begin="00:13:38.958" end="00:13:40.250" style="s2">Ah... yes.</p>
<p begin="00:13:41.333" end="00:13:43.833" style="s2">Hop in. I&#39;ll give you a ride.</p>
<p begin="00:13:45.833" end="00:13:47.833" style="s2">No, thank you. I&#39;m okay.</p>
<p begin="00:13:48.833" end="00:13:51.250" style="s2">Oh, come on.</p>
<p begin="00:13:51.250" end="00:13:53.750" style="s2">You helped me last time, remember?</p>
<p begin="00:13:53.750" end="00:13:55.833" style="s2">Don&#39;t say no. Hop in!</p>
<p begin="00:13:57.833" end="00:14:00.958" style="s2">Ah... it&#39;s okay, really...</p>
<p begin="00:14:07.958" end="00:14:08.916" style="s2">Come on, darling.</p>
<p begin="00:14:10.208" end="00:14:12.750" style="s2">Ah, then... yes, please. Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:14:37.041" end="00:14:37.875" style="s2">See?</p>
<p begin="00:14:37.875" end="00:14:40.208" style="s2">I told you I had a feeling we&#39;d meet again soon!</p>
<p begin="00:14:42.208" end="00:14:43.250" style="s2">Yes...</p>
<p begin="00:14:43.250" end="00:14:44.833" style="s2">thank you for the ride.</p>
<p begin="00:14:46.333" end="00:14:47.583" style="s2">But darling,</p>
<p begin="00:14:47.583" end="00:14:49.583" style="s2">where&#39;s that lovely smile?</p>
<p begin="00:14:49.583" end="00:14:51.083" style="s2">Why the long face?</p>
<p begin="00:14:51.083" end="00:14:52.000" style="s2">Is something wrong?</p>
<p begin="00:14:53.875" end="00:14:55.250" style="s2">No...</p>
<p begin="00:14:55.250" end="00:14:56.916" style="s2">I&#39;m just a little tired.</p>
<p begin="00:14:57.208" end="00:14:59.833" style="s2">Oh, come on, give me a smile.</p>
<p begin="00:14:59.833" end="00:15:03.583" style="s2">It&#39;s a shame to waste such a pretty face on a frown.</p>
<p begin="00:16:03.458" end="00:16:05.208" style="s2">See?</p>
<p begin="00:16:05.208" end="00:16:07.375" style="s2">Look how pretty you are when you smile.</p>
<p begin="00:16:27.583" end="00:16:29.291" style="s2">See you again, gorgeous.</p>
<p begin="00:16:30.083" end="00:16:31.708" style="s2">Yes, thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:16:31.708" end="00:16:32.791" style="s2">Drive safely.</p>
<p begin="00:16:38.041" end="00:16:39.583" style="s2">Hana!</p>
<p begin="00:16:39.583" end="00:16:41.333" style="s2">Oh, Jihoon.</p>
<p begin="00:16:41.333" end="00:16:42.375" style="s2">Are you just getting to work?</p>
<p begin="00:16:43.708" end="00:16:45.625" style="s2">Who&#39;s that?</p>
<p begin="00:16:45.625" end="00:16:46.541" style="s2">Someone you know?</p>
<p begin="00:16:46.833" end="00:16:49.708" style="s2">He&#39;s someone I happened to meet recently.</p>
<p begin="00:16:49.708" end="00:16:52.000" style="s2">I was running late today, and he gave me a ride.</p>
<p begin="00:16:53.833" end="00:16:54.791" style="s2">Oh...</p>
<p begin="00:17:01.250" end="00:17:03.583" style="s2">Last night, a prisoner transport to another prison</p>
<p begin="00:17:03.583" end="00:17:05.583" style="s2">was involved in an accident,</p>
<p begin="00:17:05.583" end="00:17:07.458" style="s2">and a drug offender on board,</p>
<p begin="00:17:07.458" end="00:17:09.625" style="s2">surnamed Choi, has gone missing.</p>
<p begin="00:17:12.083" end="00:17:15.333" style="s2">Choi, even while imprisoned in the Philippines,</p>
<p begin="00:17:15.333" end="00:17:17.208" style="s2">directed drug distribution in South Korea,</p>
<p begin="00:17:17.208" end="00:17:18.666" style="s2">according to authorities.</p>
<p begin="00:17:18.666" end="00:17:21.333" style="s2">In 2026, the South Korean government</p>
<p begin="00:17:21.333" end="00:17:22.333" style="s2">asked Philippine authorities</p>
<p begin="00:17:22.333" end="00:17:23.958" style="s2">directly for his extradition,</p>
<p begin="00:17:23.958" end="00:17:25.833" style="s2">and he was returned to Korea.</p>
<p begin="00:17:27.208" end="00:17:29.750" style="s2">Police are searching the area around the crash site</p>
<p begin="00:17:29.750" end="00:17:32.500" style="s2">as they work to locate Choi.</p>
<p begin="00:17:53.833" end="00:17:56.916" style="s2">Asha, something wrong? Are you feeling off?</p>
<p begin="00:17:58.333" end="00:17:59.458" style="s2">No.</p>
<p begin="00:18:04.958" end="00:18:06.500" style="s2">We&#39;re moving tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:18:06.500" end="00:18:08.125" style="s2">I&#39;ll force my way in first.</p>
<p begin="00:18:08.583" end="00:18:12.666" style="s2">You stay back and cover me with your sniper rifle.</p>
<p begin="00:18:14.916" end="00:18:15.625" style="s2">Okay...</p>
<p begin="00:18:37.458" end="00:18:38.708" style="s2">Hey, Jian!</p>
<p begin="00:18:38.708" end="00:18:40.750" style="s2">Is everything ready?</p>
<p begin="00:18:40.750" end="00:18:44.083" style="s2">I think that gorgeous girl has completely fallen for me.</p>
<p begin="00:18:45.333" end="00:18:47.708" style="s2">Ugh, you pervert. Here we go again.</p>
<p begin="00:18:48.541" end="00:18:49.750" style="s2">Jian,</p>
<p begin="00:18:49.750" end="00:18:52.083" style="s2">don&#39;t kill that pretty girl.</p>
<p begin="00:18:52.083" end="00:18:54.083" style="s2">Can I take her with me?</p>
<p begin="00:18:54.083" end="00:18:55.583" style="s2">I like her.</p>
<p begin="00:18:56.375" end="00:18:58.500" style="s2">Oh, do whatever the hell you please.</p>
<p begin="00:18:58.958" end="00:19:00.875" style="s2">Lovely.</p>
<p begin="00:19:02.458" end="00:19:06.708" style="s2">Just for today, I&#39;ll put up with you insulting me in Korean as much as you like.</p>
<p begin="00:19:07.625" end="00:19:10.583" style="s2">But Jian, please...</p>
<p begin="00:19:10.583" end="00:19:12.375" style="s2">no drinking before a job.</p>
<p begin="00:19:25.250" end="00:19:27.250" style="s2">Damn it!</p>
<p begin="00:19:27.250" end="00:19:29.208" style="s2">Hey, you bitch!</p>
<p begin="00:19:29.208" end="00:19:30.083" style="s2">If you&#39;re going to call me out here,</p>
<p begin="00:19:30.083" end="00:19:32.041" style="s2">the least you can do is come pick me up!</p>
<p begin="00:19:38.083" end="00:19:39.333" style="s2">Oh, you&#39;re here, sis?</p>
<p begin="00:19:40.333" end="00:19:44.000" style="s2">Jian! Why did you invite that crazy bitch?</p>
<p begin="00:19:51.333" end="00:19:52.750" style="s2">Hey,</p>
<p begin="00:19:52.750" end="00:19:55.458" style="s2">you&#39;re still hanging around with this pink pervert?</p>
<p begin="00:19:56.458" end="00:19:58.458" style="s2">Actually, once this job’s done,</p>
<p begin="00:19:58.458" end="00:20:00.333" style="s2">I’m planning to replace him.</p>
<p begin="00:20:00.833" end="00:20:03.000" style="s2">Good. Smart move.</p>
<p begin="00:20:03.000" end="00:20:04.833" style="s2">He&#39;s such an idiot.</p>
<p begin="00:20:06.958" end="00:20:08.333" style="s2">Hey!</p>
<p begin="00:20:08.333" end="00:20:10.833" style="s2">Don&#39;t have your own little conversation and leave me out!</p>
<p begin="00:20:12.458" end="00:20:13.333" style="s2">So</p>
<p begin="00:20:13.333" end="00:20:15.041" style="s2">that goddamn bitch J is here?</p>
<p begin="00:20:15.750" end="00:20:17.625" style="s2">Yeah.</p>
<p begin="00:20:17.625" end="00:20:20.375" style="s2">You&#39;ve got a score to settle with J too, sis.</p>
<p begin="00:20:20.375" end="00:20:24.000" style="s2">So I thought I&#39;d give you the first shot at her.</p>
<p begin="00:20:24.250" end="00:20:25.541" style="s2">Well, well!</p>
<p begin="00:20:25.541" end="00:20:28.333" style="s2">What’s gotten into a rude little bitch like you?</p>
<p begin="00:20:28.333" end="00:20:30.708" style="s2">Great!</p>
<p begin="00:20:30.708" end="00:20:31.875" style="s2">Great!</p>
<p begin="00:20:31.875" end="00:20:33.333" style="s2">Then I&#39;ll fold that bitch</p>
<p begin="00:20:33.333" end="00:20:35.458" style="s2">right in half.</p>
<p begin="00:20:37.125" end="00:20:39.125" style="s2">You two just enjoy your vacation.</p>
<p begin="00:20:39.708" end="00:20:41.583" style="s2">It&#39;s been a while.</p>
<p begin="00:20:41.583" end="00:20:45.166" style="s2">Let your big sister show you what she can really do!</p>
<p begin="00:20:51.708" end="00:20:54.208" style="s2">Jian, what are you thinking?</p>
<p begin="00:20:55.375" end="00:20:58.583" style="s2">If she&#39;s in on this, we&#39;ll have to split the money with her.</p>
<p begin="00:20:59.708" end="00:21:01.250" style="s2">Relax.</p>
<p begin="00:21:01.250" end="00:21:03.583" style="s2">That nuthead doesn&#39;t stand a chance against J.</p>
<p begin="00:21:05.458" end="00:21:06.750" style="s2">Then why bring her in?</p>
<p begin="00:21:07.333" end="00:21:09.375" style="s2">The two of us are more than enough.</p>
<p begin="00:21:09.375" end="00:21:11.083" style="s2">We&#39;ll have a hostage, too.</p>
<p begin="00:21:12.458" end="00:21:15.416" style="s2">If she breaks one or two of J&#39;s limbs first,</p>
<p begin="00:21:15.416" end="00:21:18.083" style="s2">it&#39;ll make our job a little easier.</p>
<p begin="00:21:20.125" end="00:21:22.291" style="s2">I mean, we&#39;re already taking a hostage...</p>
<p begin="00:21:22.875" end="00:21:24.833" style="s2">This has no style at all.</p>
<p begin="00:21:24.833" end="00:21:28.208" style="s2">It&#39;s just not how I do things.</p>
<p begin="00:21:33.708" end="00:21:35.333" style="s2">Oh, please. Style?</p>
<p begin="00:21:35.333" end="00:21:37.041" style="s2">I only fight when I know I&#39;ll win.</p>
<p begin="00:21:37.916" end="00:21:39.666" style="s2">Even if it’s just one rat,</p>
<p begin="00:21:39.666" end="00:21:41.625" style="s2">I’ve gotta give it everything.</p>
<p begin="00:22:04.291" end="00:22:05.958" style="s2">Long time no see, K.</p>
<p begin="00:22:07.333" end="00:22:10.333" style="s2">Jimmy. So you&#39;re still alive.</p>
<p begin="00:22:12.125" end="00:22:13.958" style="s2">Did you all get together</p>
<p begin="00:22:13.958" end="00:22:16.875" style="s2">and agree that was how you&#39;d say hello?</p>
<p begin="00:22:33.916" end="00:22:35.541" style="s2">Where are J and Asha?</p>
<p begin="00:22:37.708" end="00:22:39.791" style="s2">They&#39;ve probably left for the mission by now.</p>
<p begin="00:22:41.833" end="00:22:43.708" style="s2">Please hurry.</p>
<p begin="00:22:43.708" end="00:22:46.625" style="s2">Don&#39;t worry, young master.</p>
<p begin="00:23:31.625" end="00:23:34.708" style="s2">Hana, now that we&#39;ve eaten,</p>
<p begin="00:23:34.708" end="00:23:36.416" style="s2">how about going to the arcade?</p>
<p begin="00:23:36.416" end="00:23:38.041" style="s2">You still need your rematch, don&#39;t you?</p>
<p begin="00:23:38.041" end="00:23:39.708" style="s2">I&#39;ll go a little easy on you today.</p>
<p begin="00:23:40.875" end="00:23:43.083" style="s2">Ah... Jihoon.</p>
<p begin="00:23:43.083" end="00:23:45.833" style="s2">I&#39;m a little tired today. I think I&#39;ll just get some rest.</p>
<p begin="00:23:47.083" end="00:23:48.333" style="s2">Oh, okay...</p>
<p begin="00:23:48.333" end="00:23:50.666" style="s2">Let&#39;s head home early tonight, then.</p>
<p begin="00:24:00.625" end="00:24:02.041" style="s2">Oh, no! Hana,</p>
<p begin="00:24:02.041" end="00:24:03.625" style="s2">I left my phone back there.</p>
<p begin="00:24:03.625" end="00:24:05.166" style="s2">Could you wait here for a minute?</p>
<p begin="00:24:06.250" end="00:24:08.208" style="s2">Sure. Take your time.</p>
<p begin="00:24:08.666" end="00:24:10.208" style="s2">I&#39;ll be right back.</p>
<p begin="00:24:10.208" end="00:24:11.708" style="s2">Don&#39;t leave without me!</p>
<p begin="00:24:29.833" end="00:24:32.458" style="s2">Hey, gorgeous. We meet again.</p>
<p begin="00:24:34.458" end="00:24:36.000" style="s2">Oh, hello.</p>
<p begin="00:24:45.666" end="00:24:46.500" style="s2">Sorry?</p>
<p begin="00:24:47.208" end="00:24:48.416" style="s2">You&#39;re.</p>
<p begin="00:24:48.416" end="00:24:49.291" style="s2">Mine.</p>
<p begin="00:24:49.291" end="00:24:50.041" style="s2">Now.</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
